  "source_code": "T=int(input())\r\ndef check(x,y):\r\n    return 2*pref[x]+pref[x+2*y]+3*pref[size-2*x-y]\r\nfor _ in range(0,T):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    nums=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    nums.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    size=len(nums)\r\n    pref=[0]*(size+1)\r\n    for i in range(size):\r\n        pref[i+1]=pref[i]+nums[i]\r\n    maxy=0\r\n    val=0\r\n    for i in range(n+1):\r\n        if val>n-i:\r\n            val=n-i\r\n        if i==0:\r\n                while val<n and check(0,val+1)>check(0,val):\r\n                    val+=1\r\n        else:\r\n                while val>0 and check(i,val-1)>=check(i,val):\r\n                    val-=1 \r\n        res=check(i,val)\r\n        if res>maxy:\r\n            maxy=res\r\n    print(maxy)",
